ail-width":84,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":84,"woocommerce_single":93,"woocommerce_single-width":84,"woocommerce_single-height":84,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":93,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":84,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":84},{"date":129,"slug":130,"title":131,"acf":133},"2025-09-25T03:45:21","social-media-graphics-design",{"rendered":132},"Social Media Graphics Design",{"thumbnail":134,"frame_1":163,"frame_2":168,"frame_3":169,"frame_4":170,"frame_5":171},{"image":135,"excerpt":162},{"ID":136,"id":136,"title":137,"filename":138,"filesize":139,"url":140,"link":141,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":12,"name":142,"status":15,"uploaded_to":143,"date":144,"modified":144,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":19,"type":20,"subtype":21,"icon":22,"width":145,"height":146,"sizes":147},2150,"1 (1)","1-1.png",416245,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1-1.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/index.php/portfolios/business-card-design/1-1/","1-1",2147,"2025-09-24 09:36:40",1080,1350,{"thumbnail":148,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":149,"medium-width":150,"medium-height":29,"medium_large":151,"medium_large-width":152,"medium_large-height":153,"large":154,"large-width":155,"large-height":156,"1536x1536":140,"1536x1536-width":145,"1536x1536-height":146,"2048x2048":140,"2048x2048-width":145,"2048x2048-height":146,"woocommerce_thumbnail":157,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":158,"woocommerce_single-width":159,"woocommerce_single-height":160,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":161,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1-1-150x150.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1-1-240x300.png",240,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1-1-768x960.png",768,960,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1-1-819x1024.png",819,1024,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1-1-300x300.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1-1-600x750.png",600,750,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1-1-100x100.png","The goal was to highlight the value—listings for only $2 each—while showcasing credibility and trustworthiness through strong branding and clear visuals",{"banner":164,"header":12,"description":166,"tags":167},{"ID":136,"id":136,"title":137,"filename":138,"filesize":139,"url":140,"link":141,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":12,"name":142,"status":15,"uploaded_to":143,"date":144,"modified":144,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":19,"type":20,"subtype":21,"icon":22,"width":145,"height":146,"sizes":165},{"thumbnail":148,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":149,"medium-width":150,"medium-height":29,"medium_large":151,"medium_large-width":152,"medium_large-height":153,"large":154,"large-width":155,"large-height":156,"1536x1536":140,"1536x1536-width":145,"1536x1536-height":146,"2048x2048":140,"2048x2048-width":145,"2048x2048-height":146,"woocommerce_thumbnail":157,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":158,"woocommerce_single-width":159,"woocommerce_single-height":160,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":161,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"2. The Challenge\r\n\r\nCommunicating value quickly: Viewers needed to immediately understand the offer and its benefits.\r\n\r\nStanding out visually: Competing services often use cluttered or generic layouts; this design needed to feel premium yet approachable.\r\n\r\nPlatform relevance: Since the service covers Shopify, Etsy, Amazon, and eBay, it was important to show recognizable elements from online marketplaces.\r\n\r\nBalancing professionalism and energy: The design had to feel trustworthy while exciting enough to drive conversions.\r\n\r\n3. Our Approach\r\n\r\nLuxury branding: Using the gold Hidden Treasures crest at the top reinforces authority, trust, and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nStrong hierarchy: Bold typography with “BOOST YOUR SALES!” immediately grabs attention, while the supporting copy clearly explains the $2 service.\r\n\r\nVisual proof: Screenshots of live product listings on a laptop were included to establish authenticity and instantly connect the design to real eCommerce platforms.\r\n\r\nSimple iconography: Bullet points summarize key benefits—eye-catching listings, sales optimization, fast turnaround—so readers grasp the value in seconds.\r\n\r\nDark background: A sleek black backdrop was chosen to make the gold logo pop and to keep focus on the bright, professional elements.\r\n\r\n4. The Solution\r\n\r\nA clean, centered composition anchored by the Hidden Treasures logo for brand recognition.\r\n\r\nA mockup laptop display featuring eBay product listings to demonstrate the service in action.\r\n\r\nLarge, impactful typography to emphasize the offer and value proposition.\r\n\r\nSupporting text that clarifies features, target platforms (Shopify, Etsy, Amazon, etc.), and a direct call-to-action encouraging immediate engagement.\r\n\r\n5. Outcome & Key Takeaways\r\n\r\nThe final design communicates professionalism and trustworthiness while clearly presenting the $2 offer.\r\n\r\nBy pairing luxury branding with practical visuals (laptop mockup + marketplace screenshots), the ad appeals to sellers who want quality and efficiency.\r\n\r\nThe design achieves a balance of eye-catching appeal and conversion-focused messaging, making it ideal for both social media promotions and website use.",false,{"image":167,"title":12,"description":12},{"testimonial":167},{"image":167,"title":12,"description":12},{"image":167,"title":12,"description":12},1764437080909]